tagged deployment points, as well as a change that is deployed and later
reverted:

 %syntax-version=1.0.0
 +users_table
 +insert_user
 +update_user
 +delete_user
 +dr_evil
 @root
 @alpha

 +widgets_table
 +list_widgets
 @beta

 -dr_evil
 +ftw
 @gamma

