be in any of the formats described for C<index_of()>.

=head3 C<find>

  my $change = $plan->find('6c2f28d125aff1deea615f8de774599acf39a7a1');
  my $foo    = $plan->find('@foo');
  my $bar    = $plan->find('bar');
  my $bar1   = $plan->find('bar@alpha')
